  "title": "Instruction on Bank Data Reporting for the Purpose of  Monitoring Selected Monetary Flows",
  "text": "APPLICABLE TO ALL BANKS\nNo.3\nNo.3\nK. No. 245\nPursuant to Article 68 of the Law on the National Bank of Serbia (\"RS\nOfficial Gazette\", Nos. 72/2003 and 55/2004), the Governor of the National\nBank of Serbia hereby issues\nI N S T R U C T I O N\nОN BANK DATA REPORTING FOR THE PURPOSE OF MONITORING\nSELECTED MONETARY FLOWS\n1. For the purpose of monitoring selected dinar and foreign currency\nmonetary aggregates, banks shall submit to the National Bank of Serbia\nrelevant data on the MA form, attached hereto and constituting integral part\nthereof.\nTo facilitate data reporting on the MA form, the contents of individual\npositions thereof are hereby explained from the viewpoint of analytical\naccounts in the Chart of Accounts for Banks and Other Financial\nOrganizations as defined by Instruction on Analytical Accounts in the Chart\nof Accounts for Banks and Other Financial Organizations (\"RS Official\nGazette\", No.15/2007) and Instruction on the Obligation and Manner of\nRecording, Collecting, Processing and Reporting Data on the Bookkeeping\nAccount Positions of Banks and Other Financial Organizations (\"RS Official\nGazette\", No.15/2007):\n1) position 1 – Dinar vault cash – balance on account 001 shall be\nentered;\n2) position 2 – Total dinar lending to non-banking sector – balance on\naccounts contained under positions 2.1, 2.2. and 2.3 shall be entered;\n3) position 2.1 – Dinar lending to government – balance on the following\naccounts shall be entered: 0025, 2020, 2021, 2023, 2024, 2026, 20290,\n\n2\n20291, 20293, 20294, 20296, 2120, 2121, 2123, 2124, 21260, 21261, 21263,\n2127, 21280, 21281, 21283, 21284, 21286, 21287, 21290, 21291, 21293,\n21294, 21296, 21297, 21298, 2220, 2221, 2223, 22290, 22291, 22293, 2280,\n2281, 2283, 22890, 22891, 22893, 2320, 2321, 2323, 2324, 2326, 23290,\n23291, 23293, 23294, 23296, 2410, 24110, 24111, 2413, 2414, 24150,\n24151, 2417, 24180, 24181, 24183, 24184, 24190, 24191, 24193, 24194,\n24195, 24197, 24198, 30